IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Una bella tazza di caffè caldo{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
è il modo migliore per farsi
passare l'abbiocco,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Che bello prendersi un caffè
in tutto relax il sabato,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0019:}}La mattina ho sempre un sonno...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Meno male che c'è il caffè
a svegliarmi!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0019:}}Ich brauch mehr Kaffee, sonst krieg
ich meine Augen nicht richtig auf.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Siehst du meine Tasse irgendwo?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I always get sleepy after lunch,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
so I drink coffee to wake up!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002A:}}Whooooo!{{TAG:0007:0000:3C000000}} {{TAG:0003:0019:}}Yaaaawn...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}The coffee{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} and my sleepiness are
duking it out,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Eh?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Si bebo café antes de irme
a la cama, ¿no podré dormir?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Je, je, je!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡No te preocupes!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Yo soy inmune a eso!

{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Huy, ¿has echado una siesta
demasiado larga?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Yo también.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Por eso ahora no puedo dormir.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Oh, anche tu hai dormito troppo?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Anch'io.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sarà per quello che non
riesco a prendere sonno!

ES:
¡Me encanta el café {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}blue mountain{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Además ese nombre mola bastante,
¿a que sí?

IT:
Adoro il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}caffè ristretto{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}
È talmente concentrato che mi
tiene sveglio per tre minuti di fila!

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Adoro il caffè {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}espresso{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Sembra il nome di un treno.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Chissà se esiste anche il "caffè
interregionale" e il "caffè merci"?!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I always get the coffee {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}blend{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}There's so many different flavors,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
it HAS to be good!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Yo siempre tomo el café {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mezcla{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Al haber tantos sabores distintos,
¡alguno será bueno seguro!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ordino sempre il {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}caffè lungo{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sai com'è...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi sembra che
non finisca mai!

EN:
I like {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}a lot of milk {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}in my coffee.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}It tastes really delicious,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} like 
coffee-flavored milk,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
Me gusta el café con {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}muchísima
leche{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0004:}}Me parece delicioso, porque{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
es como leche con sabor a café.

IT:
Il caffè mi piace con {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tanto {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}latte.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Così diventa caffellatte{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} e{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ci puoi
inzuppare i biscotti, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
Me gusta el café con {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}no demasiada
leche{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}"No demasiada" es para mí{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
la cantidad perfecta,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich tu mir immer nur {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}einen kleinen
Schuss {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Milch in meinen Kaffee,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nicht mehr!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}A mí me gusta tomar el café{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}sin {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}leche.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Qué "sofistificado"
soy, ¿a que sí?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Ich trink meinen Kaffee {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ohne {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Milch.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das macht man nämlich als richtiger
Cowboy so.

ES:
¡Yo siempre me tomo el café
con {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tres terrones{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} de azúcar!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Así está muy dulce,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

FR:
Je bois mon café avec {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}trois sucres{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Comme ça il est aussi sucré qu'un
bonbon, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}} !

IT:
Nel caffè io ci metto sempre
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}tre cucchiaini{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} di zucchero!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Così diventa dolcissimo!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Creo que {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}dos terrones{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} de azúcar
son la cantidad justa para el café.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Con eso queda bastante dulce,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
pero tampoco sin empalagar.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Pour moi, un café parfait est un
café avec {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}deux sucres{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Comme ça il a un bon goût sucré,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
mais pas trop.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bence kahvede {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}2{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} şeker tam
kararında.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Biraz tatlı oluyor,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ama şekerleme gibi de değil.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}A mí me gusta el café con solo
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}un terrón{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} de azúcar.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}} Más que nada,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
para verlo disolverse.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¡Me relaja!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ben kahvemi sadece {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}1{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} şekerle içerim.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Şekerin eriyişini izlemeyi seviyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Çok rahatlatıcı.

EN:
I don't put {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}any {{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}sugar in my coffee.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Don't tell anyone, though.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} It would
ruin my reputation as a candy freak.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Pensi che mi piaccia il caffè
molto dolce? E invece no...{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Niente zucchero{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} nel mio caffè!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001A:}}Ti prego, non dirlo a nessuno!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ho una reputazione da golosone
mangiadolci da mantenere!

DE:
Ich trink meinen Kaffee {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}ohne
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}Zucker.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Was guckst du da so überrascht?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Mir schmeckt er halt so!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}The first person to drink coffee
must have been super brave.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}I wouldn't drink{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} this black sludge if I
didn't know it was coffee.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}La primera persona que se bebió
un café debía de ser supervaliente.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Yo no bebería esta{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} cosa negra rara
si no supiera que es café.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Kahveyi ilk içen kişi bayağı
cesurmuş.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Ben kahve olduğunu bilmesem{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
bu kara çamuru hayatta içmezdim.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Drinking coffee here is way funner
than doing it alone at home,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Beber café aquí mola mil veces
más que hacerlo solo en casa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kenner kaufen {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Kofis{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} Kaffee.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Na?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das hab ich mir gerade
